#: ../../reference/index.rst:4 98244a18a7f54ca7a6f54502dc5f2d66
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architettura"

#: ../../reference/index.rst:8 4876b7c1b0ca4d2286bb89040d2c518b
msgid ""
"The technical reference is maintained in English, like the code it "
"describes: the vocabulary here — ``competition``, ``event``, ``round`` — "
"is the vocabulary of the source. The jury-facing pages are translated. "
"See the :ref:`glossary` for the terms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:13 570c1d0f7c4c4f2eb4a4c6ccfa25dea6
msgid "Three layers, in one direction only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:26 95ad72bf786441edbc7015a3393d1ec6
msgid ""
"``core.store`` is the only module in ``core/`` that touches the "
"filesystem; ``core.paths`` is the only one that knows whether the app is "
"a checkout or an installed program."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:32 51f919f8e5e6489098ae0d31f0654854
msgid "Ground rules"
msgstr "Le regole di fondo"

#: ../../reference/index.rst:34 4607087d5179484694c967460f8d4eab
msgid ""
"These hold everywhere in the codebase, and most of this reference is a "
"consequence of one of them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:37 5eea898cc5514172a5d9adc2738ff944
msgid ""
"**Nothing under** ``core/`` **imports Streamlit.** The domain — scoring, "
"composition tables, the register, the medal count — is plain Python and "
"is tested headless."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:41 1978770aa81f49e081424de11f957d61
msgid ""
"**Nothing outside** ``core/i18n/`` **writes prose.** Every word that "
"reaches a screen or a sheet is a catalogue lookup. ``tests/test_i18n.py``"
" enforces it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:44 1077cbb2160c4118a15c0e0b9eb72ad6
msgid ""
"**Nothing is ever lost.** Every write is atomic, keeps the previous "
"content as a snapshot, and is recorded in an append-only journal. The "
"federation's entry workbook is not written to at all unless the "
"competition explicitly asks for it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:48 f3fcc54794524979a77b45116c4be3d5
msgid ""
"**The regulation is data.** Distances, event definitions, category codes,"
" sheet notes, communiqué merge rules and penalty tables are JSON files "
"under ``regulations/``, not code. A rule that changes next year is a file"
" edit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:52 e92c3d80e77b4d83829b48cdcb73ea0d
msgid ""
"**A proposal is not a decision.** What the regulation suggests — a "
"round's distance, a communiqué number, the wording of a decision — is "
"filled in and stays editable. Nothing the app proposes is more true than "
"what the jury types over it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:59 19d3ba03897e41578face89d9364b1ca
msgid "``core/`` — the domain"
msgstr "``core/`` — il dominio"

#: ../../reference/index.rst:65 65370ca9e3034c3ba4d4c139ba7a09c9
msgid "Module"
msgstr "Modulo"

#: ../../reference/index.rst:66 a295a81bbf084df0b831a4850e1a2323
msgid "What it owns"
msgstr "Di che cosa risponde"

#: ../../reference/index.rst:67 524842ca03954cb18a7c3abe5f422262
msgid "``config.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:68 d6bd41b4208742fdb7afcaed0279f2af
msgid ""
"``programme.yaml`` → dataclasses: ``Competition``, ``Category``, "
"``Event``, ``Round``, ``ProgrammeItem``, ``CommuniqueSpec``, "
"``Branding``, ``EntrySheet``, ``Check``. The vocabulary of everything "
"else."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:72 14cee6eb2ff544b0b8cfccd95f996d3e
msgid "``programme.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:73 fff57d3d147f466899f984be6968244c
msgid ""
"The other direction: ``Competition`` → text, in a stable layout, plus the"
" validation that runs before a save."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:75 082937c72eae44e6b8c3e067611b9874
msgid "``models.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/index.rst:76 cb5e5ba4144b4e48b4fe6c463b107b71
msgid ""
"``Rider``, ``Team``, ``Pair``, ``RaceState``, ``Status``, ``EntryList``. "
"Plain data, ``to_dict`` / ``from_dict``."
msgstr ""

